plicitly. A field added to ListGrid in the\nfuture would silently be dropped from copies (shared by reference, or left at\nits default) unless copy() is updated too, with nothing forcing that update.\n\nAdd a reflection-based test that enumerates ListGrid's declared instance\nfields and fails loudly if the set drifts from what copy() (and the test's\nown list) currently accounts for, pointing whoever changes it back at\ncopy(). Also add a short comment at the copy() call site referencing the\ntest, so the risk is visible at the point most likely to be edited.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"c26c04ef827b53154ba5549b3c8e4081ae7f9a72","tree_id":"6949df713d45007b58792c9bb77f0061796bb4e3","timestamp":"2026-10-23T06:23:48Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java